{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Shuyun Huazhang&quot; is a digital innovation design project of Sanxingdui Museum. It covers rich content: the digital scenes include innovative museums and fantastic Sanxingdui ruins; the digital characters are meticulous from the human body to accessories, materials, hair, etc.; the digital film and television include two-dimensional and three-dimensional, showing wonderful; digital interaction supports VR and Windows, with diverse experiences; VFX uses Naigara, Houdini, EmberGen and other technologies to create cool special effects, so that Sanxingdui culture blooms new charm in digitalization.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3444640?t=1741441760","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444640/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741441760","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444640/147d483f6991ece39706f84c4bf64a97b2ab2676/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741441760","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444640/147d483f6991ece39706f84c4bf64a97b2ab2676/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741441760","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Shuyun Huazhang&quot; is a digital innovation design project of Sanxingdui Museum. It covers rich content: the digital scenes include innovative museums and fantastic Sanxingdui ruins; the digital characters are meticulous from the human body to accessories, materials, hair, etc.; the digital film and television include two-dimensional and three-dimensional, showing wonderful; digital interaction supports VR and Windows, with diverse experiences; VFX uses Naigara, Houdini, EmberGen and other technologies to create cool special effects, so that Sanxingdui culture blooms new charm in digitalization.</p>","developers"